From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 22:08:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 49/49] win32u, winewayland: Optimize CPU-backed surface
 updates.

Advertise the foreign GDI SHM transport only when wl_shm is available.
Track damage independently for each stable slot so reused buffers copy
only pixels changed while the consumer owned them.

Also trace why managed dma-buf presentation falls back to host WSI.
---
